        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "In the event an employee or the Company believes an overpayment/underpayment has occurred a Company representative and the employee or their union representative agrees to meet to review relevant facts. If it is determined that an overpayment/underpayment has occurred, the Company will appropriately adjust future sales compensation payouts to address the situation. However, the Company will not require the employee to pay back any overpayment from his/her base salary. If the employee moves to a position that is not covered by a Public Communications Incentive Plan, or is separated from the Company, he or she will not be liable for any repayment.",
            "block_bbox": [
